WEBVTT

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:56.580
<b>Tsubasa Chronicle</b>

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:56.580
<b>Shunraiki</b>

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:59.650
Oboete iru hi no hikari de

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:04.820
kotori no you ni mezameta hi wo

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:15.620
Mirai nante atarimae ni kuru mono da to omotte ita

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:26.430
Suki na hito to zutto issho ni itai sonna tanjun na yume wo

00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:37.190
kanaerarezu ni bokura wa koko de hanarete shimau no

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:46.860
Hayaku ichiban taisetsu na hito no tokoro e

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:57.370
kono mama kimi wo hontou ni ushinau sono mae ni

00:01:57.460 --> 00:02:02.630
Kotae wa tokku ni kimatte'ru

00:02:02.710 --> 00:02:11.680
Omoi wo katachi ni kaerunda

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:27.140
There are two Syaoran-kuns?

00:02:29.570 --> 00:02:33.310
You're the Syaoran-kun I met at Yuuko-san's shop, right?

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:35.230
But why...

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:41.000
Even though it might be painful,

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.570
I'll do what I have to.

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:44.950
That's why...

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:48.370
You have to do what you think it's right!

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:52.580
Because you're the other me!

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:39.540
Syaoran-kun.

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:45.050
You have the feather, right?

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:52.800
Forget about them!

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:53.390
So...

00:03:58.140 --> 00:03:59.860
I will bring you back the feathers.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:02.740
Without fail.

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:14.290
Syaoran-kun!

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:28.220
<i>Fuuka Shourai!</i>

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:55.330
Since you're me...

00:04:57.050 --> 00:05:00.440
I'll finish you with these hands.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:17.510
<b>I wonder if Syaoran is okay.</b>

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:21.510
I can't cross dreams anymore.

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:24.590
All I can do is believe in him...

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:27.590
Believe that he will make it back safe.

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:30.740
<b>I believe in him too.</b>

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:40.970
Won't you go after him?

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:46.230
I don't have magic powers anymore.

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:49.130
And, even if I did...

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:54.590
I would wait. Even though it's painful.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:00.480
It wasn't easy at all.

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:04.780
You see, I agree with you this time.

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:11.950
From the beginning you were planning
to hand that feather over to that guy?

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:13.690
Who knows.

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:16.260
You're one screwed-up guy.

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:19.040
Right after you find someone interesting, you start teasing him.

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:21.900
That's why those twins are running from you.

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:25.600
It was kinda troublesome that Kamui didn't like me either.

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:28.030
That's just what you deserved, right?

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:29.630
Who knows.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:36.410
However, I hope he makes it back safe.

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:43.840
It might be harder than it seems.

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:22.200
Raitei...

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:25.250
Shourai!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:45.190
Syaoran!

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:14.130
The cherry tree...

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:17.240
Something has happened inside the Dream.

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:20.160
<b>Syaoran! Sakura!</b>

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:47.660
Get away!

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:28.450
Syaoran-kun...

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:38.420
The only thing I need from the Himes is the body.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:43.970
I don't care if the soul is being killed.

00:10:58.660 --> 00:11:01.940
Why won't I move?

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:07.480
The memories of the body?

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:12.410
Sometimes, when the heart has forgotten,
the body might still remember.

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:17.300
That's a problem.

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:20.670
Then, take care of Syaoran's real body first.

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:23.630
I must get the feathers back!

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:28.120
To do that, I have to take care of those who get in the way.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:29.100
No!

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:31.940
Syaoran-kun!

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:36.060
No, if you kill him everything will be over!

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:40.480
Even you and me!

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:45.530
Kill him.

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:50.160
No!

00:11:57.580 --> 00:11:58.540
Brat!

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:00.090
Syaoran-kun!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:06.870
<b>Did something happen inside the dream?</b>

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:40.320
Sakura-chan!

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:47.920
<b>Syaoran!</b>

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:31.890
Sakura!

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:38.890
I'm not your Sakura.

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:42.900
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:50.180
<i>Maybe... We were meant to meet each other.</i>

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:55.660
<i>You see, soon it'll be my birthday.</i>

00:13:55.660 --> 00:14:00.870
<i>I'll tell you the what I wanted, so just wait a little.</i>

00:14:10.560 --> 00:14:14.760
That's because I'm just like you.

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:21.510
You already knew, right?

00:14:21.510 --> 00:14:24.300
You knew that I'm not the real Sakura.

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:27.970
<i>It's not my heart that tells you
that Sakura is the most important person for you.</i>

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:29.100
<i>Your heart does!</i>

00:14:29.990 --> 00:14:31.470
I'm sorry.

00:14:32.110 --> 00:14:33.670
And also...

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:35.730
Thank you.

00:14:36.070 --> 00:14:39.670
Your Sakura is waiting.

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:43.500
That's why, please... From now on...

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:47.060
For the sake of the person you really treasure...

00:14:47.060 --> 00:14:48.490
Be free!

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:03.390
Even though we're just artificial beings... We are the same. That's why.

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:08.440
As long as the two of them keep living, it won't end.

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:13.610
I'm in lo...

00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:56.240
That guy is...

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:58.820
<b>He's the same from Jade Country and Piffle World!</b>

00:16:00.490 --> 00:16:01.660
Sakura-chan!

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:03.120
<b>Sakura is being...</b>

00:16:05.870 --> 00:16:07.790
This time I will take it with me.

00:16:09.090 --> 00:16:10.430
Fuuka...

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.120
Wait!

00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:17.410
Wait!

00:16:30.680 --> 00:16:31.840
<b>Syaoran!</b>

00:16:34.070 --> 00:16:35.930
<b>Syaoran! Syaoran!</b>

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:39.580
<b>Sakura has been taken!</b>

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:45.330
The other Syaoran is gone too.

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:03.870
<b>Did Sakura's spirit vanish?</b>

00:17:06.610 --> 00:17:09.000
<b>Did the Hime know all this time?</b>

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:11.230
<b>That she was an artificial being.</b>

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:17.690
I think it's most likely that Sakura has known about
it since she got her feather back in Tokyo.

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:21.660
Not just because that's when the other Syaoran-kun left...

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:26.620
Since then, she started to change.

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:30.770
It wasn't that she couldn't accept Syaoran-kun,

00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:35.090
but rather that she realized she was a clone.

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:40.280
She also knew that Syaoran-kun's real Sakura is somewhere else.

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:44.050
She's been so cold on purpose.

00:17:45.150 --> 00:17:48.600
From now on, be free!

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:57.180
Even so, in order to escape the fate she met in her dream,

00:17:57.180 --> 00:17:59.280
she did everything she could.

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:01.780
<b>Sakura...</b>

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:05.040
When did you find out?

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:07.660
I knew from the very beginning.

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:10.160
I heard it all,

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:13.370
from the one who planned this journey.

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:20.340
That's why I wanted to be able to grant that
wish, if there was any chance that I could.

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:25.940
Sakura-hime's clone was different from Syaoran's.

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:30.520
Syaoran's clone only copied the original's body.

00:18:31.070 --> 00:18:34.560
The one who gave it a heart was the real Syaoran.

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:39.370
But for Sakura-chan's clone, both body
and soul were artificially created.

00:18:39.370 --> 00:18:44.530
That's why the feathers, which scattered from
the clone, were same as the original's.

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:48.010
But why were the clones made that way?

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:49.530
Maybe...

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:53.140
If something were to happen to the clone,

00:18:53.140 --> 00:18:55.490
as long as he had the real Sakura-chan...

00:18:55.490 --> 00:19:00.180
He could easily replace her, Fei Wang must have thought.

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:07.960
Also, he could repeat the same thing over and over.

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:14.640
Although, to do this, he had to sacrifice countless
innocent lives of artificial beings.

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:18.610
Did the Himes' spirit vanish?

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:20.600
<b>Sakura!</b>

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:24.530
<b>It doesn't matter if it was a clone.</b>

00:19:24.860 --> 00:19:27.370
<b>Sakura is Sakura!</b>

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:29.590
That's right.

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:35.190
I was watching your journey all the time...

00:19:35.850 --> 00:19:37.240
And that's why...

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:40.500
I'll bring her back!

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:48.540
Fei Wang's wish is the thing that everybody wishes for...
As long as there's somebody they don't want to lose.

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:52.470
But, once you've lost somebody, he'll never come back.

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:56.570
Where has Sakura's body been taken?

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:57.730
Mekyo!

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:01.400
I have a wish.

00:20:02.440 --> 00:20:04.900
Please tell me Sakura's whereabouts.

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:08.390
Which Sakura are you looking for?

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:09.320
I'm looking for both of them.

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:13.290
I won't let Sakura die!

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:18.250
And if I tell you, what are those two going to do?

00:20:19.430 --> 00:20:20.290
I'll go with him!

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:22.210
I'm going too.

00:20:26.810 --> 00:20:31.410
It's the same as when they came to the shop for the first time.

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:36.500
About the price...

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.310
I've already received it.

00:20:41.580 --> 00:20:42.730
<b>From whom?</b>

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:46.410
From the one who is closer to Syaoran than anybody else.

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:53.200
Also, he paid me in the past, the same price
the Hime who traveled with you paid.

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:56.230
The same price as the Hime, meaning...

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:57.410
Memories.

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:03.220
He forgot his past, the name of his parents...

00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:07.720
He even forgot paying that price to me.

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:09.680
And you are?

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:11.390
Kimihiro Watanuki.

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:14.220
Watanuki is written just like the first of April, right?

00:21:14.220 --> 00:21:16.600
How did you know? I didn't tell you!

00:21:17.690 --> 00:21:20.210
You've told me before.

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:23.060
Even though you don't remember.

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:26.430
Everything for the same wish as you.

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:27.720
Syaoran.

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:32.770
Fei Wang is in Clow Country.

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:37.910
He's inside a frozen time, okay?

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:46.860
Reading time, reading space, manipulating countless lives, I did
everything to obtain this body engraved with dimensions.

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:49.980
I finally got my hands on this!

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:54.550
If this hadn't returned, everything would have been in vain.

00:21:55.760 --> 00:21:57.890
What about Sakura-Hime's real body?

00:21:58.490 --> 00:22:02.350
After I created this clone, it disappeared.

00:22:04.020 --> 00:22:07.050
However, I foresaw this too.

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:15.000
With this body and the Himes' soul, I will obtain
the power to cross dimensions and...

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:18.180
I'll achieve my dream!

00:22:24.160 --> 00:22:27.630
Your brother seems quite busy.

00:22:27.980 --> 00:22:32.430
Even though you invited him so nicely,
he just went to the next world.

00:22:32.960 --> 00:22:36.100
They should be those in a hurry.

00:22:36.460 --> 00:22:40.210
Does your brother have something he wishes?

00:22:40.210 --> 00:22:40.890
Yes.

00:22:42.240 --> 00:22:46.030
And he will do anything to make it true.

00:22:47.050 --> 00:22:52.500
Both happiness and unhappiness exist within the wishes.

00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:55.570
And that's how it will be as long as people wish.

00:22:55.990 --> 00:22:58.850
Please, try rest a little.

00:23:02.270 --> 00:23:03.500
<b>Sakura.</b>

00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:27.500
Sakura!

00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:35.240
Come in.

00:23:36.920 --> 00:23:38.700
You noticed that I was here right away.

00:23:39.640 --> 00:23:41.480
Just like in the old days.

00:23:41.480 --> 00:23:48.990
No matter where I would hide to surprise you,
you would find me right away, Kurogane.

00:23:48.990 --> 00:23:51.870
Isn't that how a shinobi should be?

00:23:52.290 --> 00:23:54.920
Also, I always know where you are.

00:23:56.300 --> 00:23:57.890
Since it's you.

00:24:12.330 --> 00:24:13.650
Ginryuu?

00:24:14.210 --> 00:24:16.160
I am very sorry.

00:24:16.160 --> 00:24:18.580
I didn't bury it in your mother's grave.

00:24:18.580 --> 00:24:21.370
I kept it here with me.

00:24:21.370 --> 00:24:26.160
That's because, before she died, your mother called me to Suwa.

00:24:26.160 --> 00:24:28.270
And this is what she wished.

00:24:29.160 --> 00:24:30.430
Tomoyo...

00:24:30.430 --> 00:24:31.130
Yes.

00:24:32.100 --> 00:24:35.510
I will leave Nihon Country once again.

00:24:36.150 --> 00:24:38.090
But i will be back for sure.

00:24:38.720 --> 00:24:40.550
For this, let me make the vow again.

00:24:43.330 --> 00:24:46.300
My whole existence is for my master.

00:24:46.510 --> 00:24:49.820
My whole existence belongs to my master.

00:24:49.820 --> 00:24:53.180
I swear in front of my master that I will be loyal.

00:24:53.880 --> 00:24:57.550
I swear this upon my own true name,
which is known only by my master.

00:25:02.490 --> 00:25:03.980
Be blessed.

00:25:06.180 --> 00:25:07.370
You-ou!

00:25:19.700 --> 00:25:20.880
Do you mind if I disturb you?

00:25:23.670 --> 00:25:24.820
Thank you.

00:25:26.640 --> 00:25:27.610
Sakura...

00:25:28.120 --> 00:25:30.060
Thank you for staying by the Himes' side.

00:25:31.480 --> 00:25:34.460
I couldn't do more.

00:25:36.700 --> 00:25:39.360
That was what she needed the most.

00:25:42.420 --> 00:25:44.830
Sakura-chan is waiting...

00:25:51.120 --> 00:25:52.030
Yes.

00:26:05.060 --> 00:26:07.930
<b>Both Kurogane and Fay are wearing their old clothes.</b>

00:26:22.550 --> 00:26:23.870
<b>That outfit...</b>

00:26:24.310 --> 00:26:26.450
Those are Syaoran-kun's clothes.

00:26:30.340 --> 00:26:31.280
Mokona.

00:26:31.280 --> 00:26:32.040
<b>Yes?</b>

00:26:32.660 --> 00:26:35.830
You only have one chance to enter the frozen time of Clow Country.

00:26:38.210 --> 00:26:43.330
With the price of his memories, Watanuki
let you know the location of Fei Wang.

00:26:43.330 --> 00:26:45.260
Don't miss this chance.

00:26:59.080 --> 00:26:59.820
Thank you.

00:27:00.330 --> 00:27:04.780
I hope you'll bring back the person you treasure so much.

00:27:09.320 --> 00:27:11.860
Let's go to Clow Country!

00:27:17.710 --> 00:27:23.720
Kaze no naka de kimi ga naite'ru no

00:27:23.800 --> 00:27:29.850
furimukeba mou kikoenaku naru

00:27:29.930 --> 00:27:36.150
Utsutsu na no ka maboroshi na no ka

00:27:36.230 --> 00:27:42.780
Yuganda toki wo boku wa samayou

00:27:42.860 --> 00:27:48.990
Doko e itta no?
Ano koro no keshiki

00:27:49.080 --> 00:27:55.250
Komorebi no sasu
seseragi de asonde'ta

00:27:55.330 --> 00:28:02.210
Futari no koe wa
mori ni tojikomerarete

00:28:02.300 --> 00:28:07.720
natsu no mukou ni kakurete'ru

00:28:07.800 --> 00:28:13.850
Toozakaru kimi no yobigoe

00:28:13.930 --> 00:28:20.150
yamanai kaze no sukima wo fukinukete

00:28:20.230 --> 00:28:26.320
Mienai kage kimi wo sagashite

00:28:26.410 --> 00:28:32.490
boku wa yami no naka e shizunde'ku

00:28:32.580 --> 00:28:46.550
Kurai mori no oku de
kimi ga waratte iru
